		(uuid "52cef889-26d8-40d5-8890-2877023e0f25")
	)
	(text "WHY DIFFERENTIAL (spec Sec.5.6): the rig sits in a Faraday cage sound booth."
		(at 240.03 66.03999999999999 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "c7995f02-3045-486f-9165-928ff1843344")
	)
	(text "Sensors inside are battery powered so no mains conductor crosses the cage wall --"
		(at 240.03 71.12 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "8f3c8db5-5a33-4b70-8003-7f54ad6a79b5")
	)
	(text "only signal, through a BNC shield. Whether the bulkhead bonds that shield to the"
		(at 240.03 76.2 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a9901d32-0ea9-4691-81e6-76046763dbe7")
	)
	(text "cage shell is UNDECIDED. If it does, circulating current in the shield (which is"
		(at 240.03 81.28 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "cdaadc30-e661-4190-bff0-564289d38d1a")
	)
	(text "also the signal return) would add straight onto the signal through a plain AGND-"
		(at 240.03 86.36000000000001 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "14825720-88b6-4207-a0aa-51532f792d37")
	)
	(text "referenced buffer. The shield cannot simply be lifted -- it IS the return path."
		(at 240.03 91.44 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "65535111-ce41-4a1d-8391-a3fe3582fe0e")
	)
	(text "So every front end senses centre against shield AT THE CONNECTOR and a difference"
		(at 240.03 96.52000000000001 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a096166f-895f-420c-976c-7205be8687d1")
	)
